   "title": "KeyStep Manual v1.1.2 (Arturia)",
   "url": "https://www.arturia.com/api/download/products/keystep/manual/KeyStep_Manual_1_1_2_EN.pdf",
   "note": "mod strip CC 1, pitch strip = pitch bend snapping to centre, sustain CC 64; user channel set with Shift + key"
  },
  {
   "title": "Spectrasonics — Setting up the KeyStep 37 (non-official)",
   "url": "https://support.spectrasonics.net/manual/Omnisphere3HW/3/en/topic/setting-up-the-keystep-37",
   "note": "knob bank 1: CC 74, 71, 76, 77"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Channel 1 and lowest key C3 (48) are assumptions (the manual leaves the defaults to MIDI Control Center); the keys follow any note on the channel, so an octave shift on the unit just scrolls the on-screen keys. Knob banks 2–4 are not mapped. The original 32-key KeyStep has the same strips and pedal: use this profile or generic-keys25/49.",
